<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#sub> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The eProcurement Ontology Submission core describes the concepts and properties representing the European Public Procurement Submission domain. The provision of these semantics offers the basis for a common understanding of the domain for all stakeholders ensuring the quality of data exchange and transparency. The ontology restrictions are published in a separate artefact."@en .
